<section class="page-hero shell compact"><p class="kicker">Secure checkout</p><h1>Complete your order.</h1><p>Delivery and totals are calculated server-side from your saved address and current catalogue.</p></section><section class="section section-tight shell checkout-grid"><form method="post" action="<?=e(url('/checkout'))?>" class="checkout-main"><?=csrf_field()?><input type="hidden" name="checkout_key" value="<?=e(checkout_idempotency_token())?>"><section class="checkout-card"><div class="step-label">01</div><div><h2>Delivery address</h2><?php if(!$addresses):?><p>Add an address before continuing.</p><a class="btn dark" href="<?=e(url('/account/address/new'))?>">Add address</a><?php else:?><div class="address-options"><?php foreach($addresses as $a):?><label><input type="radio" name="address_guid" value="<?=e($a['guid'])?>" <?=(!empty($a['is_default'])||count($addresses)===1)?'checked':''?>><span><strong><?=e($a['name'])?></strong><small><?=e($a['line1'])?> · <?=e($a['city'])?> <?=e($a['pincode'])?></small></span></label><?php endforeach;?></div><?php endif;?></div></section><section class="checkout-card"><div class="step-label">02</div><div><h2>Delivery service</h2><p>We validate your selected pincode at the moment you place the order. Pune Urban supports optional installation for eligible pieces.</p><label class="checkline"><input type="checkbox" name="installation" value="1"> Add installation when available</label></div></section><section class="checkout-card"><div class="step-label">03</div><div><h2>Payment</h2><p>This staging release uses a signed sandbox payment flow. No real money is collected.</p><label class="payment-choice"><input type="radio" checked> <span><strong>Atelier Sandbox</strong><small>Signed webhook + replay-safe idempotency</small></span></label></div></section><button class="btn dark wide" type="submit" <?=!$addresses?'disabled':''?>>Create order & continue to sandbox payment</button></form><aside class="order-summary elegant"><p class="kicker">Your selection</p><?php foreach($lines as $line):?><div class="mini-line configured"><span><?=e($line['p']['name'])?> × <?=e((string)$line['qty'])?><?php if(!empty($line['configuration_summary'])):?><small><?php $bits=[];foreach(array_slice($line['configuration_summary'],0,4) as $cs){if(($cs['value']??'')!=='Not selected'&&($cs['value']??'')!=='None')$bits[]=$cs['value'];}echo e(implode(' · ',$bits));?></small><?php endif;?></span><b><?=money($line['line_total'])?></b></div><?php endforeach;?><div class="summary-total"><span>Cart subtotal</span><strong><?=money($subtotal)?></strong></div><small>Delivery, installation and GST breakdown are finalized from your selected pincode on the server.</small></aside></section>
